{"answer": "The address of the Identification Register (ID) is **00008H** [S2] [S4].\n\nWhile source [S1] lists a \"Module Identification Register\" (MODID) at address **10004H**, sources [S2] and [S4] specifically identify the \"Module Identification Register\" with the short name **ID** at offset address **00008H** [S2] [S4].", "base_url": "http://106.106.152.161:4000/v1", "candidate_k": 12, "chunks": "data/chunks_i2c_ch34_v2.jsonl", "collection": "I2C_Ch34_v2", "dry_run": false, "embedding_model": "BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5", "mode": "hybrid", "model": "code", "question": "What is the address of the Identification Register?", "rrf_k": 60, "sources": [{"bm25_rank": 1, "bm25_score": 13.114373937538794, "chunk_index": 80, "hybrid_rank": 1, "id": "S1", "page_end": 1424, "page_start": 1424, "score": -0.032018442622950824, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 4}, {"bm25_rank": 10, "bm25_score": 9.659241551096867, "chunk_index": 93, "hybrid_rank": 2, "id": "S2", "page_end": 1433, "page_start": 1433, "score": -0.02967032967032967, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 5}, {"bm25_rank": 6, "bm25_score": 10.112828936806112, "chunk_index": 79, "hybrid_rank": 3, "id": "S3", "page_end": 1423, "page_start": 1423, "score": -0.029236022193768675, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 11}, {"bm25_rank": null, "bm25_score": null, "chunk_index": 89, "hybrid_rank": 4, "id": "S4", "page_end": 1431, "page_start": 1431, "score": -0.01639344262295082, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 1}, {"bm25_rank": null, "bm25_score": null, "chunk_index": 92, "hybrid_rank": 5, "id": "S5", "page_end": 1432, "page_start": 1432, "score": -0.016129032258064516, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 2}], "timestamp": "2026-05-26T14:03:23.900172+00:00", "token_param": "max_completion_tokens", "top_k": 5}
{"answer": "The GCE bit in the ADDRCFG register represents the **general call (GC) address matching enable**. When this bit is set, the device is enabled to react when it receives a general call address (0x00). Upon detection of a general call, a GC request is issued, and the device must set an acknowledge on the I2C-bus [S1].", "base_url": "http://106.106.152.161:4000/v1", "candidate_k": 12, "chunks": "data/chunks_i2c_ch34_v2.jsonl", "collection": "I2C_Ch34_v2", "dry_run": false, "embedding_model": "BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5", "mode": "hybrid", "model": "code", "question": "What does GCE bit of ADDRCFG register represent?", "rrf_k": 60, "sources": [{"bm25_rank": 2, "bm25_score": 9.557995807429162, "chunk_index": 31, "hybrid_rank": 1, "id": "S1", "page_end": 1392, "page_start": 1392, "score": -0.03225806451612903, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 2}, {"bm25_rank": 8, "bm25_score": 7.131858384471599, "chunk_index": 42, "hybrid_rank": 2, "id": "S2", "page_end": 1396, "page_start": 1396, "score": -0.031099324975891997, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 1}, {"bm25_rank": 7, "bm25_score": 7.293022866240664, "chunk_index": 38, "hybrid_rank": 3, "id": "S3", "page_end": 1395, "page_start": 1395, "score": -0.029418126757516764, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 9}, {"bm25_rank": 1, "bm25_score": 11.704216073277824, "chunk_index": 43, "hybrid_rank": 4, "id": "S4", "page_end": 1396, "page_start": 1396, "score": -0.01639344262295082, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": null, "bm25_score": null, "chunk_index": 107, "hybrid_rank": 5, "id": "S5", "page_end": 1443, "page_start": 1443, "score": -0.015873015873015872, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 3}], "timestamp": "2026-05-26T14:03:25.265942+00:00", "token_param": "max_completion_tokens", "top_k": 5}
{"answer": "The provided context does not explicitly recommend which specific interrupts should be enabled. It only defines the reset states and the function of the mask registers:\n\n*   **Protocol Interrupts:** After reset, all protocol interrupt sources are enabled (Application Reset Value: `0000 007FH`) [S1].\n*   **Error Interrupts:** After reset, all error interrupt sources are enabled (Application Reset Value: `0000 000FH`) [S4].\n*   **Interrupt Mask Control:** After reset, all requests in the Interrupt Mask Control Register are disabled (Application Reset Value: `0000 0000H`) [S2].", "base_url": "http://106.106.152.161:4000/v1", "candidate_k": 12, "chunks": "data/chunks_i2c_ch34_v2.jsonl", "collection": "I2C_Ch34_v2", "dry_run": false, "embedding_model": "BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5", "mode": "hybrid", "model": "code", "question": "Which interrupts are recommended to be enabled?", "rrf_k": 60, "sources": [{"bm25_rank": 2, "bm25_score": 9.827042663649939, "chunk_index": 120, "hybrid_rank": 1, "id": "S1", "page_end": 1454, "page_start": 1454, "score": -0.03200204813108039, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 3}, {"bm25_rank": 6, "bm25_score": 6.918977175171676, "chunk_index": 111, "hybrid_rank": 2, "id": "S2", "page_end": 1447, "page_start": 1447, "score": -0.030776515151515152, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 4}, {"bm25_rank": null, "bm25_score": null, "chunk_index": 112, "hybrid_rank": 3, "id": "S3", "page_end": 1447, "page_start": 1447, "score": -0.01639344262295082, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 1}, {"bm25_rank": 1, "bm25_score": 10.116843776465315, "chunk_index": 117, "hybrid_rank": 4, "id": "S4", "page_end": 1451, "page_start": 1451, "score": -0.01639344262295082, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": null}, {"bm25_rank": null, "bm25_score": null, "chunk_index": 32, "hybrid_rank": 5, "id": "S5", "page_end": 1392, "page_start": 1392, "score": -0.016129032258064516, "source": "I2C Ch34", "vector_rank": 2}], "timestamp": "2026-05-26T14:03:27.426842+